e, please."}],"examples":[{"en":"Would you like a cup of tea?","fa":"یک فنجان چای میل دارید؟"},{"en":"I'd like a table for two, please.","fa":"لطفاً یک میز برای دو نفر می‌خواهم."}],"collocations":["would you like","I'd like","I'd love to"],"usage":"در رستوران و فروشگاه I'd like … از I want … مؤدبانه‌تر است.","mistake":{"wrong":"Would you like coming with us?","right":"Would you like to come with us?","why":"بعد از would like فعل با to می‌آید."},"pronunciation":{"gb":"/wʊd/; weak /wəd/; 'd /d/","us":"/wʊd/; weak /wəd/; 'd /d/","note":"l در would خوانده نمی‌شود: «وود»."},"check":[{"type":"cloze","id":"c1","text":"___ you like some more rice?","answer":"Would","accept":["would"],"fa":"باز هم برنج میل دارید؟","why":"پیشنهاد مؤدبانه."},{"type":"choice","id":"q1","prompt":"In a café, you say: ___","options":[{"text":"I'd like a lemonade, please.","ok":true,"why":"درخواست مؤدبانه."},{"text":"I would like to a lemonade.","ok":false,"why":"پیش از اسم، to لازم نیست."},{"text":"I like a lemonade, please.","ok":false,"why":"like یعنی «به‌طور کلی دوست دارم»، نه سفارش."}]},{"type":"produce","id":"p1","prompt":"دوست دارید با ما بیایید؟","frame":"___ you like to come with us?","answer":"Would","accept":[],"why":"دعوت مؤدبانه."}]}],"version":"cfd45f0cf397","order":482,"unit":6,"prerequisites":["lex:A1:travel"],"released":false},{"id":"lex:A1:keep","headword":"keep","goals":["everyday","work","study","general"],"senses":[{"id":"lex:A1:keep","pos":"verb","gloss":"نگه داشتن","meaning":"چیزی را پیش خود یا در جایی نگه داشتن، یا در حالتی نگه داشتن (keep warm). بی‌قاعده: keep / kept / kept. «ماشین را نگه دار» یعنی بایست: stop.","grammar":[{"pattern":"keep + thing","note":"Keep the change. Please keep this letter."},{"pattern":"keep + thing + place","note":"Keep the milk in the fridge."},{"pattern":"keep + adjective","note":"keep warm, keep quiet"}],"examples":[{"en":"Please keep this letter.","fa":"لطفاً این نامه را نگه دار."},{"en":"We keep our bikes behind the house.","fa":"دوچرخه‌هایمان را پشت خانه نگه می‌داریم."}],"collocations":["keep the change","keep warm","keep quiet","keep a secret"],"mistake":{"wrong":"Keep the car here, please.","right":"Stop the car here, please.","why":"«ماشین را نگه دار» یعنی بایست: stop؛ keep یعنی چیزی را پیش خود نگه داشتن."},"pronunciation":{"gb":"/kiːp/; kept /kept/","us":"/kiːp/; kept /kept/"},"check":[{"type":"cloze","id":"c1","text":"___ the milk in the fridge, or it will go bad.","answer":"Keep","accept":[],"fa":"شیر را در یخچال نگه دار، وگرنه خراب می‌شود.","why":"keep + چیز + جا."},{"type":"choice","id":"q1","prompt":"I ___ all my old photos in a box.","options":[{"text":"keep","ok":true,"why":"نگه داشتن چیزها."},{"text":"stop","ok":false,"why":"stop یعنی متوقف کردن."},{"text":"hold","ok":false,"why":"hold یعنی در دست گرفتن، نه نگهداری طولانی."}]},{"type":"produce","id":"p1","prompt":"بقیه‌اش مال خودتان (پول خرد را نگه دارید).","frame":"___ the change.","answer":"Keep","accept":[],"why":"Keep the change = بقیهٔ پول مال شما."}]}],"version":"e1c471b7320e","order":483,"unit":6,"prerequisites":["lex:A1:travel"],"released":false},{"id":"lex:A1:without","headword":"without","goals":["everyday","work","study","general"],"senses":[{"id":"lex:A1:without","pos":"preposition","gloss":"بدونِ","meaning":"بدون داشتن یا انجام دادن چیزی. بعدش اسم یا فعل ing می‌آید: without sugar، without saying goodbye.","grammar":[{"pattern":"without + noun","note":"tea without sugar"},{"pattern":"without + verb-ing","note":"He left without saying goodbye."}],"examples":[{"en":"I drink tea without sugar.","fa":"چای را بدون شکر می‌نوشم."},{"en":"She went to school without eating breakfast.","fa":"او بدون خوردن صبحانه به مدرسه رفت."}],"collocations":["without sugar","without you","without saying","without a coat"],"mistake":{"wrong":"He left without say goodbye.","right":"He left without saying goodbye.","why":"بعد از without فعل با ing می‌آید."},"pronunciation":{"gb":"/wɪˈðaʊt/","us":"/wɪˈðaʊt/"},"check":[{"type":"cloze","id":"c1","text":"I can